WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.740
Yuji!?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:20.710
Yuji!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.540
Hold up!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.820
Yuji!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.660
D- Damn! Yuji!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.690
Yuji!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.390
Yuji!?

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.470
You can't be... what are you...?

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.680
Stop.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.010
Yuji,

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.020
Stop...

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.350
Yuji...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:03.290
Stop... Stop!!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.990
Western calendar 2031, 10-15.

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:42.500
Thanks to your well-fought battles,

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:45.000
the first drop operation produced greater results than predicted.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.900
In continuation, take up positions for a G-4 strike.

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:53.000
Repeat, take up positions for a G-4 strike!

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:57.670
It would seem as if these last battles have raised our soldiers' morale.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.240
Of course. There's no reason to let this opportunity pass.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.680
Let us immediately consider a second drop operation...

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:08.850
However, won't that annoying bunch try something again?

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.380
The people in the Science staff appear to have become quite nervous

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:16.190
over the treatment of the Sleepers.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:30.900
The day when we return to Earth by our own hand is near.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.500
All personnel, take your stations

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.480
in preparation for the second drop operation!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:05.670
Wow. It's incredible, isn't it?

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:10.680
Tony, and now Yuji... These Sleeper guys are really something else.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:15.150
Muscular strength, reflexes, responses to moving objects- take any one away,

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:19.350
and I still can't hold a candle to them. Didn't I tell you?

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.590
Those guys are different from us, after all.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:37.170
All right, we're done. Now go back to your own rooms and get your bodies some rest.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.980
- I'm exhausted!
- Oh, one other thing...

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:49.490
Yuji, I'm astonished at how your battle indices are improving.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.460
I'll be expecting so next time too.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.680
Yuji?

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:18.280
I'm going to go shoot for a while. I've finally come this far.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:22.020
How can I just take it easy and rest?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:30.590
That's right! I've finally caught up! You expect me to just be left behind alone!?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.640
Huh, is he still at it?

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.470
Ah, wait up, Yuji!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.110
Let them be. Let's both go as well.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:01.620
Excuse me for disturbing your fun.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:09.670
I'm collecting data. I had the opportunity, so I've come here directly.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.330
Seno Miyagi! I'm sure you've gotten Doug's permission to come in here, right?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.000
The Medical Rooms are under the jurisdiction

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.470
of the medical and science divisions.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:22.350
Soldiers have no grounds to turn me down. Please hurry.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.680
If it's just data, I can send it directly to your desk.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.740
There's something that bothers me.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:31.350
I want you to show me the data you just took here.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:37.960
These are the values when they're under normal circumstances...

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:39.790
If this is taken as a baseline,

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.360
I get the feeling that their values

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.300
are much lower than we anticipated when fighting.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.570
The ability conversion values for Sleepers are unknown.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:51.300
They may not necessarily correspond to our predictions.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.740
However, if the data from the ground is true,

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.980
it's not likely that such a degree of military gain can be raised as a result.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:59.420
Seno... Miyagi...

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.650
Let's go, Rick!

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.060
Hey, Marlene!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:15.990
What is Kaido Yuji to you?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.500
I would hate to see us lose precious data

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:22.010
by disrupting Kaido Yuji's unique environment.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:29.000
In order to activate up his B cells, 2805's existence should not be omitted.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:34.950
Data? My existence not omitted? His environment has already been altered.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:39.620
What is that man after, having me here...? Or is it...

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:42.960
Did he know something from the start!?

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:45.290
Hey! Wait up, already!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.530
You don't do this after calling someone along, you know?

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.630
Where in the world are you taking us?

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:52.970
Where, you ask...?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.600
Marlene?

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:14.120
What's this? Of all the places you could have brought me, a hangar?

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.320
Not much of an improvement for a change of scenery.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:19.660
Here is good.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.890
I get it. Here we can take our time enjoying ourselves

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.700
without attracting any attention, right?

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:38.780
Say what you will, you're really up to it now, aren't you?

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.960
Hey!

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:51.620
I need a favor. I want you to take this data to Seno without anyone noticing it.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:55.290
Data?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.140
Please.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:07.970
H- hey...!

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.950
Please, Rick.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:23.890
W- what? What the hell's wrong with me?

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.330
Eh, why not?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.710
What, is it already time to change shifts?

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.950
Onboard alert condition has been changed from K-2 to L-1.

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:34.650
We'll take over you duties.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.790
Understood. Thank you much.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:56.110
Corridor 32-I, clear. Corridor 32-J, clear. Corridor 32-U, clear.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.680
Earth...

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:09.350
Once the next drop operation begins, I'll be with Yuji again...

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:14.200
But, when everything is over, what happens to me?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:19.230
Don't tell me that even after the fighting is over, Yuji will be like that!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.710
I was just watching the view for a minute.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.080
I'll return to my station right now.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.050
We received your message. You too will board the Ark.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.360
Halt!

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:48.720
Get in there!

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:57.010
Apparently, the situation is even more urgent than we had thought.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:14:01.670
Come in. I welcome you, Marlene Angel.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:05.010
Seno Miyagi! What sort of stunt is this!?

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:09.580
We couldn't be sure you wouldn't run into some of their guards somewhere, you see.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:14.360
They know of your brashness, so I had to keep up the appearance.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.020
They?

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:21.360
Those who are with the High Council. Take a look at this.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:23.230
On the left are the activity values of the B cells

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:27.030
we calculated from the imaging data you gave us.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.800
By comparison, you can see how the levels on the right,

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:34.310
which Su sent to me, are clearly lower, right?

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:36.970
What does it mean?

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:39.480
Data tampering has been going on.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:44.650
The High Council does not to tell me the truth...

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:50.660
- The fact that Yuji and Tony's abilities are especially high, even for them.

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:57.330
The Sleepers may be our knockout-punch in eliminating the Blue... that much is true.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:01.100
However, they weren't just relying on their superhuman bodies

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:05.670
and reflexes to accomplish this.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:10.380
The B cells have a power hidden within them, giving the Blue an unconscious,

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.350
mutual sense of communication, as if sharing telepathy among themselves.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:16.290
The Sleepers, sensing ahead of time how the enemy is going to move,

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.690
effectively have their offensive abilities heightened.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:24.700
Mutual communication...? But why do B cells do this?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.760
Upon entering the 21st century,

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:31.960
spontaneous B cells outbreaks appeared within human society.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:35.670
Without any way to inhibit the unusual propagation of the B cells

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.640
with the medical techniques of the time,

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:42.650
those who possessed B cells reluctantly became Sleepers.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:46.340
However, at the same time, suppose that besides mankind,

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:51.980
there existed B cell test animals that were imprudently disposed of...

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:56.550
Afterwards, taking over a decade, those test animals with the B cells

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.820
would go through crossbreeding with existing stock,

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.660
and evolution would take place...

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:03.570
And so, in the western year 2017,

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:09.340
the life form that would come to be named Blue was first identified on Earth.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:12.000
J- just a minute! Does that mean...!?

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.710
You could say that the Blue's true identity

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:18.680
is that of an evolved form of the B cell itself!

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:23.690
In time, as mankind learned about the Sleepers and their B cells,

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.220
they came up with a plan to give birth to a superhuman battalion,

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.350
that could oppose the Blue.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.330
All the while knowing that by their own hand,

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.130
they would be giving birth to those that had the potential hidden within them

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.960
to become a whole new Blue.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:39.970
A whole new Blue!? You can't mean it!

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.770
Who will be left on Earth once the Blue are gone?

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:47.640
You've figured that out already, right?

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.110
A Sleeper's abilities are promoted

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:52.980
in conjunction with the activation of their B cells.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:56.990
But, while that increases a Sleeper's offensive capabilities, on the one hand,

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:58.920
if their responses are taken too far,

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.020
there are situations where abnormalities

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:03.650
in the Sleeper's very existence are brought about.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:08.000
Yuji is no longer just an ordinary human!

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:13.230
Through the workings of his B cells, he is already coming close to being a Blue!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:19.670
That can't be! It's not true!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:25.010
Unfortunately, that's the conclusion I've reached after many years of research.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.350
No! That couldn't be it!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:30.010
Yuji is different! Yuji is like me...

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.280
- a human, like me!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.920
Even if that's true about him temporarily, I won't allow that!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.620
You think I would ever allow that!?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.960
It appears I was correct in my judgement.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:46.300
No, we cannot allow the B cells to be activated any further.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:51.640
Which is why I have decided to restrain the High Council now.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.150
Those who are here are my friends, who have gathered for that purpose.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.650
The name of our organization is the Ark.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.620
Come aboard the Ark with us. After all,

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:04.990
your existence can become one of the powers that inhibits the B cells.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.650
Me?

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:12.630
Right now, you may be the one who holds the most human-like emotions.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.430
Picking up emergency orders for the combat divisions.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:22.340
The second drop operation is being carried out!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.070
The first and second advance platoons are dropping.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.240
The Sleeper brigade is being summoned.

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:44.330
Huh!? What's this, all of a sudden!?

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.630
Just as I hoped! We'll settle this all at once!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.640
Hurry and take your seat! We're leaving!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.640
Marlene isn't here yet. Are you thinking of leaving her behind?

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.300
Hurry up with your raid!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.640
She's only one escort pilot!

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:02.310
The others can fill in for her battle capacity!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.320
For crying out loud...!

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:07.750
We're moving out! Go!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.990
The arrangements for the attack appear to be ready.

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:20.620
What about him?

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:31.080
Hmph! Seno, you rascal! You and your cheap tricks!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.270
Did you think you could deceive our eyes forever?

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:37.180
I don't know what it is he's planning,

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.810
but we need to take appropriate measures against him.

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:50.760
What's the matter? Are you afraid?

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:52.960
No...

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:55.800
There is nothing to fear.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.690
The results will come out soon.

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:07.040
Yes, our decisions must always be correct, after all.

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:11.540
This can't be. Wait...!

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:41.940
Wait!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.950
Wait! Yuji!

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.610
Yuji...

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:52.220
YUJI!!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:39.540
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:45.670
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:54.820
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.940 --> 00:22:00.990
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:07.410
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:14.600
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:19.760
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:25.820
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:32.100
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:39.580
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:46.440
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:58.180
I'm going to Earth too! I cannot allow Yuji to pilot the Double Edge any longer!

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:00.520
However, so long as the current establishment is maintained,

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:03.850
we really are not saving Kaido Yuji.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:07.520
But... in that case, what am I supposed to do!?

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:12.830
There is only one way! Starting now, the Ark goes into action!
